---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/booking-check.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="How I 10x'd My Deposits: Check Your Booking Process" description="Look at your tattoo inquiries, deposits, follow-up, and income goals. Get a booking-process review and Joker Ink's free guide by email." pageType="tenx_booking_survey">
  <div class="booking-check">
    <a class="bc-skip" href="#booking-main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="bc-header bc-wrap"><a class="bc-brand" href="/">JOKER INK <span>/</span> TATASSIST</a><span class="bc-header-note">For tattoo artists</span></header>
    <div id="booking-main">
      <section id="bc-intro" class="bc-intro bc-wrap" aria-labelledby="bc-title">
        <div class="bc-intro-copy"><h1 id="bc-title">HOW I <em>10X'D</em><br/>MY DEPOSITS<br/>IN ONE MONTH</h1>
          <p class="bc-deck">I didn't get more talented. I didn't get more famous. I stopped letting good clients slip through my fingers.</p>
          <p>Before you read my story, take a look at yours. How many inquiries become deposits? Does booking depend on your memory? Is tattooing bringing in what you want?</p>
          <p id="bc-availability" class="bc-insight" role="status" hidden></p>
          <button id="bc-start" class="bc-button" type="button">Check my booking process <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
          <p class="bc-small">Answer a few questions. See your review. Get the free guide by email.</p>
          <p class="bc-disclaimer">My 10x result is my experience, not a forecast of yours. Your work, demand, pricing, and implementation all matter.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="bc-intro-aside"><img src="/lead-magnet/10x-guide-cover.svg" alt="How I 10x'd My Deposits in One Month, the free four-page guide by Joker Ink" width="612" height="792"/><p>THE GUIDE EXPLAINS WHY.<br/><strong>YOUR ANSWERS MAKE IT PERSONAL.</strong></p></aside>
      </section>
      <section id="bc-survey" class="bc-survey bc-wrap" aria-label="Your booking-process check" hidden>
        <div class="bc-progress-meta"><span id="bc-progress-text">Question 1</span><span>No right answers. Just your business.</span></div>
        <progress id="bc-progress" value="0" max="10" aria-label="Survey progress"></progress>
        <div id="bc-insight" class="bc-insight" hidden></div>
        <form id="bc-form" novalidate>
          <div id="bc-question"></div>
          <p id="bc-error" class="bc-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
          <div class="bc-controls"><button id="bc-back" class="bc-back" type="button">Back</button><button id="bc-next" class="bc-button" type="submit">Continue <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div>
          <p class="bc-data-note">Your answers stay in this tab until you submit your details. We save them with your guide request, not in advertising analytics.</p>
        </form>
      </section>
      <section id="bc-result" class="bc-survey bc-wrap" aria-label="Your booking-process review" hidden>
        <div id="bc-delivery-status" class="bc-delivery" role="status"></div>
        <p class="bc-section-label">Based on your answers</p><h2 id="bc-result-title" tabindex="-1"></h2><p id="bc-result-body"></p>
        <div id="bc-result-numbers" class="bc-result-numbers"></div>
        <p class="bc-small">This is an educational self-assessment, not a validated diagnostic or an explanation of any specific client's decision.</p>
        <div class="bc-offer"><h3>Now you have something specific to look at.</h3><p>The free guide explains the shift. The Booked Artist System gives you the implementation guides and templates to start putting a process in place.</p><a class="bc-button" id="bc-product-link" href="/lp/booked-artist-system">See the system <span>$49 launch price</span></a><p class="bc-small">One payment. No subscription. No guaranteed booking result.</p></div>
      </section>
      <noscript><div class="bc-wrap bc-noscript">This step-by-step survey needs JavaScript. Enable it to complete the check and request your guide, or email syd@tatassist.com for help.</div></noscript>
    </div>
    <footer class="bc-footer bc-wrap"><p>JOKER INK / TATASSIST</p><nav aria-label="Footer"><a href="mailto:syd@tatassist.com">syd@tatassist.com</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a></nav></footer>
  </div>
  <script>
    import '../../scripts/booking-check.js';
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
